    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "AURA Observability Notes",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**AURA does not expose a native Prometheus `/metrics` endpoint** (its Go webserver serves only `/health`, `/v1/*` and `/a2a/*`).\n\nObservability for AURA is therefore provided via:\n\n1. **Container resource metrics (this dashboard)** — CPU, memory and network from cAdvisor, filtered on `container_label_com_docker_compose_service=\"aura\"`.\n2. **Distributed traces** — AURA exports OpenTelemetry spans to VictoriaTraces via `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`. Inspect them in **Explore → VictoriaTraces** with `service=\"aura\"` to see the orchestrator/worker reasoning waterfall, tool calls, and per-step latency."
      }
    }
  ]
